 "remarks": "Welcome to 19 Woodway Road, a spacious 3-bedroom, 3.5-bath townhome offering a surprising amount of living space in one of Stamford's most convenient locations. The bright and inviting main level features a generous living room with fireplace and sliders to a private balcony, a dedicated dining area and a well-equipped kitchen with stainless steel appliances and abundant cabinetry. Upstairs, the flexible bedroom layout includes a spacious top-floor retreat with vaulted ceilings and skylights, while 2 full and 2 half baths provide plenty of room for everyday living and guests. Enjoy multiple levels of living, great natural light, ample storage and outdoor space-all with the ease of townhouse living. Ideally located near the Springdale/Darien border with easy access to shopping, restaurants, Stamford Twin Rinks, Metro-North and major commuter routes. A wonderful opportunity to enjoy space, convenience and a true neighborhood feel just minutes from everything Stamford has to offer.",
